# ZFS role layer: adds the ZFS kernel module and userspace to any
# flavor whose root lives on a pool. The module line is pinned to the
# kernels the product flavors pin (7.2.3): a pool created for a target
# whose kernel lacks its kmod is unbootable, so the engine requires
# this role (or an equivalent profile) for every ZFS root rather than
# guessing.
saphira-zfs-7.2.3
saphira-zfs-userspace
